No secure lift was confirmed, so no transport to the plate was attempted. The failure was inadequate alignment around the bowl wall and unstable rim pinches despite altered heights and tilts. With three moves remaining, opened the gripper and raised it clear, then ended the episode because another verified pick and placement could not fit the remaining budget.
